/ .NOHEADER


NOHEAD,	STA		/SET THE "NO" FLAG
	DCA NOFLG
HEADER,	TAD NOFLG	/SET THE HEADER SWITCH
	DCA SWHEAD
	TAD SWHEAD	/WAS IT "NOHEADER" ?
	SKIPYES
	JMP HEAD2	/YES IT IS, JUST RETURN
	SPNOR		/IGNORE SPACES AFTER COMMAND
	TAD CHAR
	EOCQ		/END OF COMMAND?
	 JMP HEAD2	/YES, JUST RETURN
HEAD1,	COMCHK
	  HEADWD-1
	  HEADJ-1
	TAD I [CMDLINE]	/NOT, AN ARG THERE?
