	TAD (207)	/BELL CHARACTER
	JMS TYPEIT	/PRINT IT OUT
BBRK11,	KSF
	JMP .-1		/WAIT AROUND UNTILL OPERATOR IS READY
	KRB		/READ THE CHAR
