	TAD SUBPGN	/YES
	TAD (-"Z)	/ARE WE PAST THE LETTER "Z" ?
	SZA CLA
	JMP BBRK52	/NO, WE CAN INCREMENT SUBLETTER
	ERROR		/YES, GIVE ERROR MESSAGE
	TEXT \BL\
	*.-1
	SKP
