XXGET,	0
	CLA
	RDF
	TAD (CDF CIF)
	DCA XXGETR	/SAVE FIELD FRO M WHENCE WE WERE CALLLED
	CDF 10		/WE'RE IN FIELD 1
XXGET1,	JMS I (ICHAR)
	JMP XXGETX	/ERROR RETURN
	DCA SELTMP
	TAD SELFLG	/ARE WE IN SELECT MODE?
	SKIPNO
	JMP SELECT	/YES, CHECK CHAR
XXGGOO,	TAD SELTMP	/NO, OR WE HAVE COME BACK
	AND (177)	/STRIP TO 7 BIT ASCII
	SZA
	TAD (-177)
	SNA
